This is a single Next.js v15 app (Prisma/Postgres, Better Auth, tRPC, Cloudflare R2).

This app is a music player app similar to the `soundcloud.com`.

Next.js `web` uses app router and 'better-auth' library for auth.

better-auth session/user object retriaval in server components: 

```ts

// app/page.tsx
import { auth } from "@/lib/auth";
import { headers } from "next/headers";

export default async function Page() {
    const session = await auth.api.getSession({
        headers: await headers(),
    })

    const user = session?.user
    return (<></>)
}

```

and better-auth session/user object retriaval in client components:
```tsx
import { authClient } from "@/lib/auth-client";

export default function ClientComponent() {
    const { data } = authClient.useSession();
    const user = data?.user;
    return (<></>)
}

```

